> file release-notes.html attr=619
  | <h2>Release 4.2 &mdash; &ldquo;Larkspur&rdquo;</h2>
  | <p>Use the new <code>--dry-run</code> flag to preview changes. Press <kbd>Ctrl-"</kbd> to open the palette.</p>
  | <pre><code>$ deploy --env "staging" --tag 'v4.2'
  | echo "it's done" -- really
  | </code></pre>
  | <p>Upgrading from 3.x? Read the &ldquo;Breaking changes&rdquo; section first &mdash; it&rsquo;s short.</p>
  | <pre>
  |   config['retries'] = 3   # "three" tries
  | </pre>
  | <p>Thanks to everyone who filed bugs in the &lsquo;25 beta&hellip; you know who you are.</p>
  |
> file release-notes.html attr=843
  | <h2>Release 4.2 -- "Larkspur"</h2>
