  exit 0
> smartypants -a1h posts/escapes.html
  | <p>Use &#34;dumb quotes&#34; when you mean them, and &#39;single&#39; ones.</p>
  | <p>A literal &#45;&#45; stays two dashes, &#46;&#46;&#46; stays three dots, a backslash is &#92;.</p>
  | <p>&ldquo;Backtick quotes&rdquo; and `single backticks&rsquo; too.</p>
  | <p>A &#96;backtick&#96; escaped.</p>
  |
  exit 0
